,"half":"右","leaf":"十二下","column_from_right":5,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"鄣面獨無所言帝怒曰外舍家寒乞今共作笑"},{"pdf_page":15,"half":"右","leaf":"十二下","column_from_right":6,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"樂何獨不視后曰為樂之事其方自多豈有姑"},{"pdf_page":15,"half":"右","leaf":"十二下","column_from_right":7,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"姊妹集聚而裸婦人形體以此為樂外舍為歡"},{"pdf_page":15,"half":"右","leaf":"十二下","column_from_right":8,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"適與此不同帝大怒令后起后兄揚州刺史景"},{"pdf_page":15,"half":"右","leaf":"十二下","column_from_right":9,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"文以此事語從舅陳郡謝綽曰后在家為儜弱"},{"pdf_page":15,"half":"左","leaf":"十三上","column_from_right":1,"start":0,"end":12,"text":"婦人不知今段遂能剛正如此"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-wangzhenfeng-izumo","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-wangzhenfeng-izumo"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangzhenfeng:p001","text":"明恭王皇后諱貞風，琅邪臨沂人也。初拜淮陽王妃，明帝改封，又為湘東王妃。生晉陵長公主伯姒、建安長公主伯媛。明帝即位，立為皇后。上嘗宮內大集，而裸婦人觀之，以為歡笑。后以扇鄣面，獨無所言。帝怒曰：「外舍家寒乞，今共作笑樂，何獨不視。」后曰：「為樂之事，其方自多；豈有姑姊妹集聚，而裸婦人形體，以此為樂。外舍為歡適，與此不同。」帝大怒，令后起。后兄揚州刺史景文以此事語從舅陳郡謝綽曰：「后在家為儜弱婦人，不知今段遂能剛正如此。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangzhenfeng:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"明恭王皇后","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳人名、親屬及稱號。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangzhenfeng:p001:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"貞風","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳人名、親屬及稱號。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangzhenfeng:p001:m0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"明帝","person_id":"cti_o52_4nz","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳人名、親屬及稱號。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangzhenfeng:p001:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"伯姒","person_id":"cti_o52_4nz_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳人名、親屬及稱號。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-wangzhenfeng:p001:m0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"伯媛","person_id":"cti_o52_4nz_C",